{"sourceUrl":"https://wine.nwsuaf.edu.cn/xydt/tzgg/xytzgg/918bab70ad92415ba421e78988d249c4.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:38.740541+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://wine.nwsuaf.edu.cn/xydt/tzgg/xytzgg/918bab70ad92415ba421e78988d249c4.htm","html":"<article>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>根据学校《关于做好</span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年</span><span>招收</span><span>优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生工作的通知》及《西北农林科技大学推荐优秀本科毕业生免试攻读</span><span>硕士</span><span>研究生复试录取工作暂行办法》（校研发</span><span>〔</span><span>2018</span><span>〕</span><span>258<span>号）</span></span><span>文件要求</span><span>，</span><span><span>现将我院</span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年</span><span>招</span><span>收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生复试工作安排如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>一、组织机构</span></p>\n<p><span><span>招收</span><span>推免生遴选工作组</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>  <span>长：郭建东、陶永胜</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>副组长：刘</span>  <span>旭</span></span><span><span>、孙翔宇、张</span>  <span>洁</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>成</span>  <span>员：</span></span><span>吴枚烜、</span><span>万颖敏、</span><span>魏进红</span><span>、</span><span>朱美蓉</span><sub><span>（管理代表）</span></sub><sub><span>、</span></sub><span>李俊俊</span><sub><span>（教师代表）</span></sub></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>秘</span>  <span>书：</span></span><span>吴枚烜、</span><span>万颖敏</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>职</span>  <span>责：根据学校的要求全面负责学院</span></span><span>招收</span><span>推免生工作的组织、领导和督查。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>下设两个工作小组：</span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>.<span>复试专家组</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>  <span>长：陶永胜</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>副组长：刘</span>  <span>旭、孙翔宇</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>成</span>  <span>员：</span></span><span>研究生导师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>秘</span>  <span>书：张克坤</span></span><span>（兼）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>职</span>  <span>责：全面实施</span></span><span>招收</span><span>推免生复试工作。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>.<span>监督工作组</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>  <span>长：郭建东</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>副组长：</span><span>袁照程</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>成</span>  <span>员：朱美蓉、刘文政</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>秘</span>  <span>书：朱美蓉</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>职</span>  <span>责：负责制定学院</span></span><span>招收</span><span>推免生工作监督管理细则，负责监督</span><span>招收</span><span>推免生复试录取工作，受理有关申诉及违纪、违规行为的调查处理，确保</span><span>招收</span><span>工作的公开、公平、公正。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span>029-87092107<span>，邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:ptjxy@nwsuaf.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>ptjxy@nwsuaf.edu.cn</span></a><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、</span><span>招收</span><span>类别</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.<span>硕士生：</span></span><span>“</span><span>葡萄与葡萄酒学</span><span>”</span><span>学术学位硕士生</span><span>、“</span><span>发酵工程</span><span>”和“</span><span>食品与营养</span><span>”全日制</span><span>专业学位硕士生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.<span>直博生：</span></span><span>“</span><span>葡萄与葡萄酒学</span><span>”</span><span>、</span><span>“</span><span>发酵工程</span><span>”</span><span>直博生（</span><span>仅限</span><span>工程博士专项）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、</span><span>招收</span><span>的基本条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>取得本科毕业学校推荐资格且符合《西北农林科技大学推荐优秀本科毕业生免试攻读硕士</span><span>研究生</span><span>复试录取工作暂行</span><span>办法</span><span><span>》（校研发</span>[2018] 258<span>号）第四章基本条件的学生</span></span><span>：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.<span>拥护中国共产党的领导和社会主义制度，具有高尚的爱国主义情操和集体主义精神，社会责任感强，遵纪守法，积极向上，身心健康；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.<span>诚实守信，学风端正，品行优良，无考试作弊或剽窃他人学术成果等学术不端行为；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.<span>取得本科毕业学校推荐资格，且能正常获得本科毕业证书和学士学位证书；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.<span>具有从事科学研究志向，具有较强的创新意识、创新潜质和创新能力；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5.<span>申请直博生，须通过全国大学英语六级考试（成绩</span>≥425<span>分）或小语种四级（小语种推免生须提前与招生导师联系）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四</span><span>、申请及</span><span>招收</span><span>程序</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>.</span><span>考生</span><span>登录“</span><span>中国研究生招生信息网</span><span>”</span><span>（以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>研招网</span><span>”</span><span>，网址：</span></span><a href=\"http://yz.chsi.com.cn/%EF%BC%89%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%A1%AB%E5%86%99%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%88%E5%90%AB%E8%87%AA%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%8C%E7%BD%91%E4%B8%8A%E6%94%AF%E4%BB%98%E6%8A%A5%E5%90%8D%E8%B4%B9%E3%80%82%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E6%8A%A5%E5%90%8D%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%B5%E8%AF%9D%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E8%80%83%E7%94%9F%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E5%A4%8D%E8%AF%95%E3%80%82%E8%AF%B7%E5%90%84%E4%BD%8D%E5%90%8C%E5%AD%A6%E4%BF%9D%E6%8C%81%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E7%95%85%E9%80%9A%E3%80%82\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn/<span>）通过</span></span><span>“</span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>进行注册并填报个人资料信息（含自行上传本人照片），网上支付报名费后选择报名志愿。</span></span></a></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>.</span><span>学院查看推免生相关信息，专人负责在</span><span>“</span><span>研招网</span><span>”</span><span>推免服务系统中对通过资格审查的推免生发送</span><span>“</span><span>复试通知</span><span>”</span><span>，考生点击</span><span>“</span><span>接受复试通知</span><span>”</span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span><span>.</span><span>学院组织复试，并对复试通过者及时在网上办理待录取手续。学院填写</span><span><span>“</span><span>2027</span><span>年招收推免生拟攻读硕士学位复试成绩汇总表”</span></span><span>（附件</span><span>1</span><span>）、</span><span>“</span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年</span><span>招收</span><span>推免生复试表</span><span>”</span><span>（</span><span><span>附件</span><span>2</span></span><span>）、</span><span>“</span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年</span><span>招收推免生</span><span>汇总表</span><span>”</span><span>（附件</span><span>3</span><span>）及</span><span>“</span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span><span>年招收直博生汇总表”</span></span><span>（</span><span><span>附件</span><span>4</span></span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4. 9</span>月<span>23</span>日前在本单位网站公示拟招收推免生名单。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>5</span><span>. </span><span>10<span>月</span><span>9</span><span>日结果上报研究生院。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五</span><span>、复试工作安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span><span>.</span><span>资格审查</span></span></p>\n<p><span>审查材料： </span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）有效身份证件原件及复印件</span>1<span>份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）大学期间成绩单原件（需所在学校教务部门盖章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3</span><span><span>）全国英语四六级证书或成绩单（国家成绩单未下发的考生</span>,<span>须持教务处加盖红章的成绩单）及复印件</span><span>1</span><span>份；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span><span>）以第一作者名序已经公开发表的学术论文、科研成果或获奖证书原件及复印件</span>1<span>份（限具有该材料的考生）；</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）承诺书（附件</span><span>5</span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>（</span><span>6</span><span>）</span></span><span>思想政治考核表（原单位出具）（附件</span><span>6</span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>9<span>月</span></span><span>18</span><span>日</span><span>上午</span><span>1</span><span>2</span><span><span>：</span>00<span>前，所有参加复试的考生将资格审查相关材料的扫描电子版，按以上顺序形成一个完整的</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件，以</span></span><span>“</span><span><span>姓名</span>-<span>就读学校名</span><span>-</span><span>资审材料</span></span><span>”</span><span>命名发送邮箱</span><span>464616955</span><span>@qq.com<span>进行资格审查，资格审查不通过者不能参加复试。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>以上</span><span>6</span><span><span>项材料的纸质版（其中</span>2<span>、</span></span><span><span>5</span><span>、</span><span>6</span></span><span>须为原件）待拟录取后于</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>25</span><span><span>日前（以当地邮戳时间为准）寄至学院学科办公室。（请务必使用</span>EMS<span>邮寄。邮寄地址：陕西省杨凌区西北农林科技大学北校区葡萄酒学院</span><span>619</span><span>办公室，收件人：梁老师；电话：</span><span>029-87092233</span><span>）。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span><span>.</span><span>心理测试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>时间待定，请留意</span>QQ<span>群通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span><span><span>.</span><span>面试</span></span><span>考核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>时间：</span>9<span>月</span></span><span>中下旬，具体时间地点另行通知</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>面试考核由</span><span>科研潜质考核</span><span>与</span><span>思想政治品德</span><span>考核两部分组成。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>科研潜质</span><span><span>成绩满分为</span>100<span>分，由外语水平（</span><span>20</span><span>分）、专业素质和能力（</span><span>60</span><span>分）及综合素质（</span><span>20</span><span>分）三部分组成。思想政治品德考核</span></span><span><span>成绩满分为</span><span>100</span><span>分。</span></span><span>外语</span><span>水平重点</span><span>考察听力和口语</span><span>能力</span><span>。专业素质和能力主要考察专业知识和相关基础知识的广度和深度</span><span>，考生</span><span>利用所学理论发现、分析和解决问题的能力，对本学科发展动态的了解以及在本专业领域发展的潜力；综合素质主要考察思维敏捷程度和表达能力，创新精神、事业心、责任感、职业兴趣以及知识面等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>每名考生进入现</span><span>场，</span><span><span>首先进行</span>5<span>分钟</span><span>PPT</span></span><span>汇报</span><span>，内容包括但不限于个人科研成果、研究计划</span><span>。随后</span><span>评委</span><span>开展现场问答，含思政问答、外语问答环节</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.<span>录取办法</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>复试由思想政治品德、学业成绩、科研潜质考核三个方面组成。考核总成绩满分为</span>100<span>分</span></span><span>，计算方法如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>总成绩</span>=<span>思想政治品德考核成绩</span>×10%+<span>学业成绩</span>×40%+<span>科研潜质考核成绩</span>×50%<span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>思想政治品德考核成绩、学业成绩和科研潜质考核成绩满分均为</span><span>100</span><span>分。其中，学业</span></span><span>成绩由推荐高校提供。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>按照总成绩由高到低排序，依据</span><span>招</span><span><span>收推免生的指标数确定拟录取学生名单，思想政治品德不合格及心理测试未通过的学生一票否决。科研潜质考核成绩低于</span>60<span>分者不予录取。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span>已经获得西北农林科技大学校内推免生资格的学生，不再进行科研潜质考核，其复试成绩以获得推免资格时的复试成绩为依据。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>拟录取学生名单在学院网站公示</span>3<span>日。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六</span><span>、其他</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.<span>学生可自愿申请攻读学术学位硕士研究生、直博生或专业学位硕士研究生。申请直博生的学生，</span></span><span>招收</span><span><span>指导教师应具备</span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年博士研究生招生资格。</span><span>招收</span><span><span>的直博生占导师</span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年博士招生指标。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.<span>所有</span></span><span>招</span><span>收的推免生均需登录</span><span>“</span><span>中国研究生招生信息网</span><span>”</span><span><span>（网址：</span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn/<span>），进行注册、报名，直至确认录取。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.<span>进入录取范围考生如遇导师招满的情况下可再调整</span></span><span>招收</span><span>导师。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.<span>根据《西北农林科技大学研究生招生工作回避规定》</span>(<span>校研发</span>[2020]106<span>号</span>)<span>等文件，严格执行回避规定。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.<span>联系人：梁润雅</span></span><span>、吴枚烜</span><span><span>老师，电话：</span>029-87092233<span>；邮箱：</span></span></span><a href=\"mailto:343245483@qq.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>343245483@qq.com</span></a><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>6.<span>报名学生请尽快加入学院专项工作群（</span><span>QQ</span><span>群号：</span></span><span>322408367</span><span>），</span><span>所有</span><span>重要通知后续会在群内发布。验证信息请备注</span><span>“</span><span><span>姓名</span>+<span>本科学校</span></span><span><span>”，并修改群昵称为（姓名</span><span>+</span><span>本科院校）</span></span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://wine.nwsuaf.edu.cn/images/2026-09/3e77c5ea1dc7404ca17338d65e685a2d.png\"/><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>葡萄酒学院</span></p>\n<p><span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span>6</span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span></span><br/></p>\n<div>\n<h3>相关附件:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wine.nwsuaf.edu.cn/docs/2026-09/c489b1f7a2fc496686c859539609b701.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件6 - 2027接收推免生思想政治考核表.docx</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wine.nwsuaf.edu.cn/docs/2026-09/a1a4fede04654d97a4e4704716c19862.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件5 - 承诺书.docx</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wine.nwsuaf.edu.cn/docs/2026-09/6cc8d20b0e3b4d2ca9ff842aeaa2cd3d.xlsx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件4 - 2027年招收直博研究生汇总表(系统字段).xlsx</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wine.nwsuaf.edu.cn/docs/2026-09/3776d5ecea594b1ea9e50cba247a82cb.xlsx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3 - 2027年招收推免生汇总表（系统字段）.xlsx</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wine.nwsuaf.edu.cn/docs/2026-09/c778b83810f2473899e74fa3a936392f.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2 - 2027年招收推免生复试表.docx</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wine.nwsuaf.edu.cn/docs/2026-09/ca9768b0e6dc467b82a80e3f91ee9545.xlsx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1 - 2027年招收推免生拟攻读硕士学位复试成绩汇总表.xlsx</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</article>","textSha256":"172d08ea511e378f24295aa9fe8b571a4c24ddd0001512d3696b7e36cd949dc0","textLength":2844,"sourceSha256":"f445930f02f818a3aed2ec0c07d374224bf78f2023085b55e647805088762720","selector":"article-like:leading-loose lg:px-8 py-4 space-y-4 content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-237b42568dd1f3fdfcca","title":"2026年西北农林科技大学葡萄酒学院2027年招收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生复试工作通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:38.740541+00:00"}
